{
  "name": "Awake & dev mode: listening delivers within two check-ins, every way out, the latch, Bluetooth apps",
  "reviewer_setup": "A local_test build. The unit needs saved WiFi (wifi <ssid>|<pass>). Start a LAN test-mode copy of the site (isolated data directory, never a live account) and link this unit's device id to a test account there. Environment: CF_BENCH_BASE=http://<LAN-IP>:<port>, CF_BENCH_TOKEN=<the unit's 43-character link credential>, CF_DEV_STAGE_A / CF_DEV_STAGE_B = host commands that send one wasm app with manifest id $CF_DEV_APP_ID through the site as the studio does (A with fixtures/breakout.wasm, B with fixtures/stopwatch.wasm, so B is a new version of the same id - the site needs op 'replace' for an app already on the Fidget), CF_DEV_APP_ID=<that id>, CF_DEV_STUDIO_ON = a host command that marks the Studio as sending to this Fidget (POST /api/device-studio-activity.php {device_id, active:true} as the account); the site paces dev mode at 2 s only while the Studio is active (60 s), 30 s otherwise. Run: python test/bench/cf_replay.py test/bench/cases/t379-devmode-poll.json --port <PORT> --out <dir> [--part delivery|exits|latch|bluetooth]. Every part starts and ends with the mode Off. A delivered app and listening do not fit in internal RAM together, so listening pauses while the app runs and every open after the network was used goes through a restart ('reopen').",
  "parts": [
    {
      "name": "delivery",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "reset"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake set off",
          "timeout_s": 4
        },
        {
          "do": "reset"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 6000,
          "why": "let the start-up check-in (if linked) finish before the credential changes"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "cloud base $CF_BENCH_BASE",
          "expand_env": true,
          "contains": [
            "[cmd] cloud.base=ok"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "cloud token $CF_BENCH_TOKEN",
          "expand_env": true,
          "contains": [
            "[cmd] cloud.token=ok"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 11000,
          "why": "the site takes a mode change at most once per 10 s; the start-up check-in just reported normal"
        },
        {
          "do": "host",
          "command": "$CF_DEV_STUDIO_ON",
          "expand_env": true,
          "timeout_s": 30
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake set dev until",
          "until": "[dev] poll=1 ",
          "timeout_s": 30,
          "order": [
            "[awake] set mode=dev stop=until effect=restart",
            "[awake] boot mode=dev stop=until listen=1 bt_released=1",
            "[awake] listen=start",
            "[dev] poll=1 http="
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "watch",
          "until": "[dev] poll=3 ",
          "timeout_s": 15,
          "matches": "wait_ms=(19|2[0-9])[0-9]{2} "
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake",
          "contains": [
            "awake.mode=dev stop=until listen=1 worker=1",
            "connected=1",
            "bt_restart=1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "host",
          "command": "$CF_DEV_STAGE_A",
          "expand_env": true,
          "timeout_s": 30
        },
        {
          "do": "watch",
          "until": "[dev] delivered batch=",
          "timeout_s": 9,
          "count": "[dev] poll=",
          "max_count": 2
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "do": "assert_lget",
          "id": "$CF_DEV_APP_ID"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "launch $CF_DEV_APP_ID",
          "expand_env": true,
          "until": "[wasm] reopen=boot",
          "timeout_s": 20,
          "order": [
            "wifi=off",
            "[wasm] reopen=restart id=",
            "radio_used=1",
            "[boot] fw=",
            "[awake] boot mode=dev stop=until listen=1",
            "[wasm] reopen=boot id=",
            "found=1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "do": "assert_wasmstat",
          "frames_gt": 0,
          "error": "none",
          "timeout_s": 3.0
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake",
          "contains": [
            "listen=1 worker=0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "host",
          "command": "$CF_DEV_STUDIO_ON",
          "expand_env": true,
          "timeout_s": 30
        },
        {
          "do": "host",
          "command": "$CF_DEV_STAGE_B",
          "expand_env": true,
          "timeout_s": 30
        },
        {
          "do": "watch",
          "until": "[dev] delivered",
          "timeout_s": 6,
          "expect_absent": true
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "launch menu",
          "until": "[wasm] reopen=boot",
          "timeout_s": 25,
          "order": [
            "[awake] listen=start",
            "[dev] delivered batch=",
            "[dev] relaunch id=",
            "from=menu",
            "[wasm] reopen=restart",
            "[boot] fw=",
            "[wasm] reopen=boot id=",
            "found=1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait",
          "ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "do": "assert_wasmstat",
          "frames_gt": 0,
          "error": "none",
          "timeout_s": 3.0
        },
        {
          "do": "screencap",
          "save": "reopened",
          "review": "human"
        },
        {
          "do": "launch",
          "id": "menu"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake set off",
          "until": "[awake] boot mode=off",
          "timeout_s": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "exits",
      "steps": [
        {
          "do": "reset"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake set off",
          "timeout_s": 4
        },
        {
          "do": "reset"
        },
        {
          "do": "wait_cli"
        },
        {
          "do": "command",
          "command": "awake set dev idle",
          "until": "[dev] poll=1 ",
          "timeout_s": 30,
          "contains": [
            "[awake] boot mode=dev stop=idle listen=1"
          ]
